@startuml
' THE CASE LOOP — expand the frontier until nothing new comes back.
' Convergence is the stop condition; a depth/round cap is only a backstop, and hitting it is
' reported as `awaiting-analyst`, never as done.
!include _theme.puml

start
:**Collect the pending seeds**
<size:11>free-only pivots -> zero API credits</size>;
:**Ingest -> KB**
<size:11>every artifact becomes a shared node</size>;
:**Cluster · snapshot the round**
<size:11>rounds.jsonl (append-only)</size>;

:**Compute the FREE frontier**
<size:11>new registrable apexes found for free this round:</size>
<size:11>crt.sh SAN siblings · passive-DNS co-hosts · urlscan related</size>
<size:11>CORS trusted origins · impersonation lookalikes · path-kit peers</size>;

if (Co-tenancy guard) then (**shared infra**)
  :**Held back — recorded as a LEAD**
  multi-tenant cert (>4 apexes)
  shared / CDN IP (>12 apexes)
  bulk registrant term (>25 domains)
  <size:11>A bad seed gets INGESTED and becomes a fake</size>
  <size:11>shared indicator in every later case.</size>; <<#FBF0EF>>
else (**operator-owned**)
endif

if (Metered pivot?\n<size:11>FOFA ip= / icon_hash= · WhoisXML reverse · Censys search</size>) then (**yes**)
  :**Deferred to `metered_leads`**
  <size:11>auto-chase FREE sources only;</size>
  <size:11>pause before spending credits</size>; <<#FDF8EC>>
else (**free**)
endif

:**Render the assessment**
<size:11>gaps · next_pivots · metered_leads</size>
<size:11>the analyst edits this to STEER the next round</size>;

if (**Stop?**) then (last N rounds added\n0 hosts AND 0 indicators)
  :**converged**; <<#F0F8F7>>
  stop
elseif (frontier empty) then ( )
  :**cold**
  <size:11>"the free search is exhausted" —</size>
  <size:11>a CLAIM, never asserted from a failed probe</size>; <<#FDF8EC>>
  stop
elseif (round cap hit,\nwork still queued) then ( )
  :**awaiting-analyst**
  <size:11>a cap is not a finding</size>; <<#FDF8EC>>
  stop
else (**new seeds**)
  :**NEXT ROUND**
  <size:11>fold analyst-directed leads in FIRST,</size>
  <size:11>then the mechanically-discovered ones</size>;
  detach
endif
@enduml
